Package: wlanpi-mcp
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: dpkg (>= 1.16.1), python3 (>= 3.13), ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, wlanpi-core, nginx-light | nginx-full | nginx-extras, ufw
Description: WLAN Pi MCP Server
 wlanpi-mcp provides a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes
 WLAN Pi capabilities to AI assistants and MCP-compatible clients.
 .
 Supports both stdio transport (for direct Claude Desktop integration via SSH)
 and SSE transport (LAN-accessible daemon mode, served over HTTPS on port
 8767 by an nginx front-end this package installs).
